class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of playable characters with unique fighting styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of anime-inspired techniques and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice-activated special attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op ability synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 duels with friends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many abilities and techniques pay homage to iconic moments from popular anime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEEP BUILD CRAFTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440650/extras/c82f1ecd319854b6da36e4c62eee2531.poster.avif?t=1788298331\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440650/extras/c82f1ecd319854b6da36e4c62eee2531.webm?t=1788298331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440650/extras/c82f1ecd319854b6da36e4c62eee2531.mp4?t=1788298331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KAGE is not a roguelike — your progress persists and your character keeps growing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade multiple weapon types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover rare items with unique effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create powerful ability synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize builds to match your playstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a glass cannon, a lightning-fast assassin, a crowd controller, or an unstoppable frontline fighter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE YOUR VILLAGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440650/extras/b4c0524955c8780f2fb8ec27772155b9.poster.avif?t=1788298331\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440650/extras/b4c0524955c8780f2fb8ec27772155b9.webm?t=1788298331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440650/extras/b4c0524955c8780f2fb8ec27772155b9.mp4?t=1788298331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t just fight — you return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions from the village elder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade village facilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain access to new techniques and gear</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your village grows stronger with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BOSS HUNTS AND MASSIVE LOCATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440650/extras/8580f42f28c38c601e29b68870911075.poster.avif?t=1788298331\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440650/extras/8580f42f28c38c601e29b68870911075.webm?t=1788298331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440650/extras/8580f42f28c38c601e29b68870911075.mp4?t=1788298331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore large and diverse areas filled with danger, secrets, a